      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Driving down the streets, you’ll notice no concrete sidewalks or overhead telephone wires, preserving a rural vibe unlike typical Long Island roads.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://hewlettbayparkny.gov/",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Hewlett Bay Park is part of the Five Towns, a cluster that includes Lawrence, Cedarhurst, Woodmere, Inwood, and the trio of Hewletts—Hewlett, Hewlett Bay Park, and Hewlett Harbor.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7
